  "description": "Yu Jeong-In is a typical office worker until she meets a sudden end and wakes up mid-kiss… with the male lead of the novel she was reading, Prince Albert! To her dismay, she realizes she is the villainess Rosé Atiers, a lustful maid locked in a tower with Albert by a king set on ruining the prince. Fated to die by his hands, Rosé strikes a deal to help him escape in exchange for money to live comfortably. But will Rosé be able to stick to her plans while living with such a handsome prince? \n\n(Source: Tapas, edited)",
